/P 101 0 R
/E (ABC National Bank has experienced rapid growth in its customer base and financial products, including deposits, loans, credit cards, investments, and retirement savings. Although the bank collects large amounts of customer data, management lacks a consolidated view of customer behavior, profitability, and financial risk. Existing reports are largely static and do not provide the insights required for strategic decision-making.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
