/P 101 0 R
/E (The leadership team faces several challenges: identifying high-value customers, understanding which customer segments contribute the highest deposits and revenue, evaluating lending risk, measuring the effectiveness of loyalty programs, and assessing investment advisor performance. These gaps lead to missed cross-selling opportunities, inefficient resource allocation, and limited ability to personalize banking services.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
